WEBVTT

00:00.400 --> 00:01.650
I'm begging you!

00:02.100 --> 00:04.590
All you have to do is introduce me.

00:04.990 --> 00:08.220
I really want to be friends with Hananoi-kun!

00:10.610 --> 00:11.740
Wha—?

01:43.370 --> 01:49.580
<b>Episode 5</b>

01:43.370 --> 01:49.580
<b>Our First Date</b>

01:45.460 --> 01:48.510
Yeah, she 100 percent has ulterior motives!

01:48.510 --> 01:50.600
Do you really think so?

01:50.600 --> 01:54.420
This doesn't usually happen,
so I'd totally forgotten

01:54.420 --> 01:56.500
how popular Hananoi-kun is with girls.

01:57.550 --> 02:03.000
I mean, he's always so cold at school
that it makes him hard to approach.

02:03.290 --> 02:08.310
You know, the girls in my club say he's 
a "look but don't touch" kind of hottie.

02:10.880 --> 02:12.400
<i>Come to think of it,</i>

02:12.400 --> 02:16.620
<i>I've never seen Hananoi-kun
 with any friends before.</i>

02:17.530 --> 02:21.290
<i>If that's all she really wants,
 maybe it would be good.</i>

02:22.150 --> 02:26.400
<i>And I'm not officially dating him,
 so I have no right to keep her away.</i>

02:26.770 --> 02:28.880
Hotaru-chan, is something wrong?

02:29.530 --> 02:32.160
You've hardly touched your lunch.

02:32.720 --> 02:34.550
I-I'm okay!

02:38.970 --> 02:45.560
U-Um, this might be an odd question, 
but how would you feel about making a friend?

02:46.540 --> 02:48.970
What? Did Kurata say something to you?

02:48.970 --> 02:50.830
Huh? Keigo-kun?

02:51.400 --> 02:52.790
Guess not.

02:52.790 --> 02:55.050
Did something happen between you two?

02:55.570 --> 02:57.700
No, nothing at all.

02:58.020 --> 03:01.330
But friends, huh? I don't think I need any.

03:01.760 --> 03:04.330
I'm actually trying not 
to make friends right now.

03:04.330 --> 03:05.840
Huh? Why?

03:05.840 --> 03:11.840
Hmm... Well, for example, let's say
there's some kind of major disaster.

03:11.840 --> 03:17.040
The first people everyone worries about 
are their relatives and lovers, right?

03:17.040 --> 03:20.410
Friends don't really rank that high,

03:20.410 --> 03:26.230
so wasting your feelings on them takes away
 from the people you really care about,

03:26.230 --> 03:27.230
I think.

03:27.230 --> 03:30.390
Do you... really feel that way?

03:30.390 --> 03:32.980
I'm good just holding one person truly dear.

03:34.580 --> 03:36.620
I've only got two hands, after all.

03:39.600 --> 03:43.400
<i>Hananoi-kun sure has
an unusual approach to things...</i>

03:43.950 --> 03:47.970
<i>But he was so clear 
about not wanting friends.</i>

03:51.550 --> 03:55.520
<i>Turning Satomura-san down 
might make things rocky.</i>

03:56.000 --> 04:02.040
<i>I think I like Sohei-kun. 
Hotaru-chan, will you help me out?</i>

04:02.820 --> 04:04.470
Awkward...

04:05.290 --> 04:09.350
<i>Man, I guess this is another side
 to what dating's like.</i>

04:09.350 --> 04:10.730
Hotaru?

04:11.160 --> 04:12.950
Did you remove all the strings?

04:12.950 --> 04:14.190
Sis...

04:14.850 --> 04:17.030
No! Master!

04:17.030 --> 04:18.150
U-Uh...

04:20.260 --> 04:25.960
So basically, a coworker asked you 
to introduce your so-called "trial" boyfriend.

04:25.960 --> 04:28.180
But you don't want to pressure him,

04:28.180 --> 04:31.200
or make things awkward at work either.

04:31.930 --> 04:33.860
You sure are growing up.

04:33.860 --> 04:36.420
How do I make it all work out?

04:37.150 --> 04:38.150
You don't.

04:39.880 --> 04:42.730
You can't live without
hurting people sometimes.

04:42.730 --> 04:45.420
You've got to decide
who's most important to you.

04:46.390 --> 04:49.430
<i>That's like what Hananoi-kun said.</i>

04:49.430 --> 04:51.600
I knew you'd help, Master!

04:51.600 --> 04:54.410
<i>I mean, not that I've ever had a boyfriend.</i>

04:57.290 --> 05:00.000
<i>I'll tell her no before
 I start my shift today.</i>

05:00.000 --> 05:01.530
<i>Not a great feeling...</i>

05:02.860 --> 05:05.070
You seem really down lately.

05:05.640 --> 05:09.110
N-No, I'm fine! It's just, today...

05:09.950 --> 05:12.820
Y'know, it's colder up here than normal, isn't it?

05:12.820 --> 05:14.580
You might be right.

05:16.680 --> 05:18.120
The door's open.

05:18.400 --> 05:21.460
The person on safety checks must 
have forgotten to close it.

05:21.460 --> 05:23.370
We could go out on the roof.

05:23.750 --> 05:25.880
<i>Th-The roof?!</i>

05:26.930 --> 05:31.720
Wow! Hananoi-kun, Hananoi-kun! 
This is awesome!

05:42.400 --> 05:44.490
I'm glad you're having so much fun.

05:44.490 --> 05:46.990
I might never get to do this again.

05:47.570 --> 05:48.610
But...

05:51.080 --> 05:55.400
B-Breaking the rules 
 is pretty exciting, isn't it?

05:56.790 --> 05:59.060
You're an awfully good girl, Hotaru-chan.

06:03.260 --> 06:04.120
Huh?

06:08.540 --> 06:11.620
It won't open. It must be locked.

06:11.620 --> 06:12.670
Huh?!

06:12.670 --> 06:14.910
Did somebody notice it was open?

06:14.910 --> 06:19.810
Probably. But it's okay.
We have our phones on us.

06:19.810 --> 06:21.020
Still...

06:26.800 --> 06:29.560
Class has started.

06:31.910 --> 06:33.660
I know you're in class. Sorry!
I'm on the roof right now.
The door seems to be locked from the inside.
Could you come open it for me?

06:32.480 --> 06:37.240
I just messaged Kyo-chan 
and Shibamu for help.

06:41.800 --> 06:45.270
Wait! Why are you slowly undressing?!

06:45.270 --> 06:47.240
I was going to let you borrow this.

06:47.240 --> 06:50.460
<i>Of course</i> you were! 
But you shouldn't do that!

06:50.460 --> 06:52.040
But under the circumstances...

06:57.050 --> 07:00.280
I'll be fine, so you should wear my cardigan.

07:00.280 --> 07:03.090
<i>You'll</i> freeze, then, Hananoi-kun!

07:03.090 --> 07:05.100
Oh, I know!

07:05.100 --> 07:06.170
Like this!

07:10.990 --> 07:13.370
<i>Actually, this probably isn't the way...</i>

07:16.970 --> 07:22.190
A-Anyway, realistically speaking, 
this should be warmest, so let's stick it out.

07:22.190 --> 07:24.330
As long as you're okay with it.

07:26.700 --> 07:31.000
I'm sorry. This is my fault for 
wanting to come out on the roof.

07:31.400 --> 07:33.240
Don't worry about that.

07:33.240 --> 07:36.570
If nobody notices, 
will we die of exposure up here?!

07:38.150 --> 07:41.960
We'll be fine. I promise we will.

07:43.670 --> 07:46.000
You didn't do anything wrong, Hotaru-chan.

07:47.510 --> 07:48.770
Relax.

07:54.370 --> 07:55.550
I'm sorry.

07:57.240 --> 08:02.920
Look, I'm sure we'll be fine, but if you 
think we're dying anyway, would you tell me?

08:04.180 --> 08:06.170
What's had you so worried lately?

08:06.170 --> 08:06.990
Huh?

08:07.270 --> 08:07.790
Uh...

08:07.790 --> 08:10.100
You haven't been finishing your lunch.

08:10.100 --> 08:14.240
And you always have two croquettes 
after school, but you only ate one yesterday.

08:14.240 --> 08:16.720
<i>He's been watching me like a hawk!</i>

08:16.720 --> 08:20.970
<i>M-Maybe it's my imagination, but... is he mad?</i>

08:23.500 --> 08:26.940
Sorry. You don't have to tell me.

08:28.100 --> 08:32.190
I just always want you to be happy.

08:35.500 --> 08:39.530
<i>I can literally feel 
how worried he is about me.</i>

08:40.180 --> 08:41.530
<i>He's so warm.</i>

08:42.070 --> 08:47.070
<i>How could I upset someone
 who thinks about me so much?</i>

08:48.410 --> 08:50.440
I'm sorry, Hananoi-kun.

08:50.440 --> 08:52.380
Um, to tell you the truth...

08:54.970 --> 08:57.480
Oh boy. Is that all?

08:57.480 --> 08:58.260
<i>"Is that all"?!</i>

08:58.700 --> 09:01.080
I'll go turn her down myself.

09:01.080 --> 09:04.680
It'd be tough for you if things
 got awkward at work, right?

09:05.080 --> 09:09.040
<i>So it's settled just like that? I guess so...</i>

09:09.820 --> 09:13.950
<i>Huh. So I didn't need to get
so worked up about it.</i>

09:16.320 --> 09:18.510
I'm so relieved!

09:19.080 --> 09:21.710
I'm glad. You're back to normal now.

09:24.030 --> 09:26.920
Are you okay? You can hold on to me tighter!

09:26.920 --> 09:32.580
No, I'm fine. Any closer would be...
 I don't know. A bad idea.

09:36.540 --> 09:39.920
D-Don't worry. The occasion calls for it.

09:40.380 --> 09:44.070
And your promise not to touch me... 
Can we call that off now?

09:48.100 --> 09:52.140
<i>Hananoi-kun's heart is beating really fast.</i>

09:52.790 --> 09:57.600
<i>I don't know why, but that's making
me so happy right now.</i>

09:58.370 --> 10:01.940
I-I'll tell Satomura-san myself.

10:03.100 --> 10:07.510
<i>With his body heat warming me, 
I feel like I can face anything.</i>

10:08.260 --> 10:11.820
I know whose feelings I value more now.

10:12.950 --> 10:14.600
It'll be fine.

10:19.480 --> 10:20.840
Bad move.

10:21.370 --> 10:23.860
Do you realize what you just said?

10:26.340 --> 10:29.360
I'm not gonna let you go now.

10:34.180 --> 10:36.480
Hotaru! Are you alive?!

10:36.920 --> 10:38.990
Huh? That's weird.

10:39.500 --> 10:43.320
H-Hello? Over here. We're over here!

10:43.320 --> 10:44.630
There she is!

10:44.930 --> 10:46.690
Are you okay?

10:46.690 --> 10:48.570
I-I'm glad you saw my message.

10:48.570 --> 10:52.000
We had a free study period. 
Oh, I'm so relieved!

10:52.000 --> 10:55.000
You know, the door wasn't 
actually locked, though.

10:55.000 --> 10:55.840
Huh?

10:57.470 --> 10:58.320
Ah...

10:59.750 --> 11:04.050
Sorry about that. I wanted some 
time to talk to you alone.

11:04.450 --> 11:08.050
I wish we could've stayed 
just a little longer, though. Too bad.

11:08.050 --> 11:12.060
Wh-Wh-What? Whaaat?!

11:12.060 --> 11:16.610
I'm sorry, but that's why I 
can't introduce you to him!

11:16.610 --> 11:20.630
Are you for real? That beautiful 
vision is your boyfriend?

11:20.630 --> 11:22.560
Hota-chan, you're amazing!

11:22.560 --> 11:23.230
Huh?

11:23.230 --> 11:27.490
Oh, wait. Did you think I liked 
Hananoi-kun or something?

11:27.780 --> 11:32.140
I'm sorry I gave you the wrong idea!
He just looks like my fave idol!

11:32.140 --> 11:33.170
Y-Your fave?

11:33.170 --> 11:36.660
Yeah! Takahiko-kun from the super 
popular idol group VERSUS!

11:36.660 --> 11:38.800
See, see?! Isn't he a dead ringer?!

11:38.800 --> 11:41.800
If he grew out his hair a little,
 he'd be perfect!

11:41.800 --> 11:45.550
When I first saw Hananoi-kun, 
I thought it was fate!

11:42.820 --> 11:44.400
<i>That's</i> what this is about?

11:45.940 --> 11:47.550
Thank you very much.

11:47.900 --> 11:52.070
<i>I'm glad Satomura-san doesn't actually 
have a crush on Hananoi-kun.</i>

11:52.620 --> 11:53.510
<i>Wait.</i>

11:55.110 --> 11:57.910
<i>What is this feeling? Relief?</i>

12:00.320 --> 12:04.320
Wanting to see him smile, 
wanting to touch him,

12:04.880 --> 12:09.040
worrying about other girls liking him...

12:09.540 --> 12:12.420
Is this love? Is that what love is?

12:12.420 --> 12:14.130
<i>Of course it's love!</i>

12:14.470 --> 12:17.220
Why would you think it isn't?

12:17.220 --> 12:20.900
To love is to think about someone
more than anyone else, right?

12:22.320 --> 12:31.060
I think I might <i>like</i> Hananoi-kun, 
but I like you guys just as much.

12:31.060 --> 12:33.520
I guess I'm just not sure yet.

12:33.520 --> 12:37.820
Ahem. Listen, love is different for everyone.

12:37.820 --> 12:42.060
If <i>you</i> think it's love, then it <i>is</i> love!

12:42.880 --> 12:45.090
Kyo-chan, you're so cool!

12:45.090 --> 12:48.870
If you're with me, then go try this on. 
You have a date tomorrow, right?

12:53.620 --> 12:56.590
<i>Maybe this is a little too cute for me.</i>

12:56.590 --> 13:00.020
<i>Everyone is different... 
Everyone is different, right?</i>

13:00.580 --> 13:01.560
<i>Okay!</i>

13:06.220 --> 13:07.680
Hananoi-kun!

13:08.970 --> 13:10.840
Thanks for waiting!

13:10.840 --> 13:14.100
S-Sorry I'm late.

13:14.100 --> 13:16.230
It's fine. Are you okay?

13:16.230 --> 13:20.610
I stayed up late looking stuff up
 and then overslept.

13:21.000 --> 13:22.780
Don't worry about it.

13:22.780 --> 13:25.870
I was so excited about today, I didn't
 sleep a wink since the day before.

13:25.870 --> 13:27.650
Not one wink since the day before?!

13:28.210 --> 13:31.580
We're seeing a movie, right? Let's get going.

13:31.580 --> 13:32.530
Okay.

13:32.920 --> 13:37.200
W-Wait, hold on. I said that I was 
going to escort you today.

13:38.970 --> 13:40.860
Let's go, Hananoi-kun.

13:49.290 --> 13:50.970
<i>Switch gears, switch gears!</i>

13:51.350 --> 13:54.600
<i>For the morning, we'll catch a movie 
before having lunch at this place.</i>

13:54.600 --> 13:58.500
<i>After browsing at the station building, 
we can grab a snack and take pictures.</i>

13:54.600 --> 13:58.850
If we get stuck, go to the station
It has lots of shops, so it'll be easy to kill time
Browse clothes and products to figure out what he's into

At karaoke, pick songs we both know
It'll be fun for both of us if we sing together

The place Kyo-chan recommended...

13:58.500 --> 14:01.980
<i>Great. For a beginner like me, 
this plan is foolproof!</i>

14:03.990 --> 14:05.530
Hold on a second.

14:09.330 --> 14:12.090
You look really cute today, Hotaru-chan.

14:14.830 --> 14:18.500
<i>H-He noticed that I look different today.</i>

14:24.140 --> 14:29.000
<i>The book Hananoi-kun was reading got made 
into a film. I thought it'd be perfect.</i>

14:33.130 --> 14:36.660
<i>But it's one of those movies where 
a bunch of people get killed!</i>

14:51.790 --> 14:55.130
Just close your eyes 
during the scary scenes.

14:56.760 --> 15:02.610
<i>I'm so scared and so excited that I 
can't concentrate on the movie one bit!</i>

15:05.130 --> 15:09.640
<i>I-I totally blew it.
I couldn't follow the movie at all.</i>

15:09.640 --> 15:13.650
<i>And I wanted for us
to talk about it afterward!</i>

15:13.650 --> 15:17.430
Hotaru-chan, are you okay? 
That was pretty scary.

15:18.380 --> 15:23.030
I-I'm okay! Just a little shocked
since I don't usually watch this genre.

15:23.030 --> 15:27.510
But I thought the story was really...
 really, uh, interesting.

15:27.510 --> 15:29.820
Why don't we go get lunch now?

15:30.760 --> 15:33.920
Lunch? Sure! I already picked out a place.

15:35.200 --> 15:38.120
<b>The place Kyo-chan recommended:
Italian restaurant "Renoge"
Interior and food both look really fancy—worth the price!
Has large servings, so boys should like it too.
Careful! Sometimes there's a line for lunch.</b>

15:37.930 --> 15:39.220
Temporarily Closed

15:43.770 --> 15:46.690
W-We'll come again another time. Okay?

15:47.910 --> 15:50.230
I'm sorry, Hananoi-kun.

15:50.580 --> 15:56.470
For what? It's okay. Things never 
work out perfectly the first time.

15:57.000 --> 16:02.620
More importantly, you put so much 
thought into planning today for me.

16:02.620 --> 16:04.460
That makes me really happy.

16:04.460 --> 16:05.610
Hananoi-kun...

16:05.610 --> 16:10.900
Hey, over there. Isn't that the restaurant 
you said you wanted to try before?

16:36.450 --> 16:39.460
Here! To commemorate today.

16:41.040 --> 16:42.110
I bought one too.

16:48.080 --> 16:49.530
We picked the same thing!

16:54.110 --> 16:57.550
I wasn't a very good escort at all.

16:57.550 --> 16:59.880
I still had a whole lot of fun, though.

16:59.880 --> 17:04.120
I had fun too! Thanks to your help.

17:04.610 --> 17:07.010
And it was very educational.

17:07.010 --> 17:12.220
You don't have to stick to a plan. 
Just find things to enjoy together.

17:12.620 --> 17:14.410
Dates sure are fun!

17:15.850 --> 17:18.690
<i>Dates with you are always so weird.</i>

17:17.870 --> 17:20.140
<i>Sorry, but you're scaring me.</i>

17:20.800 --> 17:22.710
<i>Dates sure are fun!</i>

17:33.850 --> 17:35.900
Thanks for walking me home.

17:37.260 --> 17:38.780
Oh, isn't this...

17:39.180 --> 17:41.270
The place where we first met.

17:44.010 --> 17:47.310
This park is really close 
to my elementary school,

17:47.310 --> 17:49.790
so I used to play here a lot as a kid.

17:50.870 --> 17:57.060
Come to think of it, why were you here that
 day? It's pretty far from the cafe...

17:58.050 --> 18:01.520
Were you actually at the 
cafe then too, Hotaru-chan?

18:01.520 --> 18:02.930
Mm-hmm.

18:02.930 --> 18:05.830
No wonder. That's why you
 offered me your umbrella.

18:05.830 --> 18:09.970
Well, I was kind of worried 
it was none of my business.

18:11.530 --> 18:15.740
I wandered around in a daze 
and suddenly found myself here.

18:16.440 --> 18:20.370
I was pretty depressed that day.

18:23.900 --> 18:25.110
That's why...

18:26.540 --> 18:27.960
Hotaru-chan,

18:29.130 --> 18:30.910
you're my hero.

18:35.870 --> 18:37.660
I'm so happy.

18:39.030 --> 18:43.570
Ever since I met you here, I've been in bliss.

18:46.000 --> 18:47.480
It almost scares me.

18:48.720 --> 18:50.060
Hananoi-kun...

18:51.200 --> 18:52.380
Bam!

18:59.990 --> 19:02.820
Hananoi-kun? Hananoi-kun?

19:03.470 --> 19:05.030
Are you awake?

19:11.620 --> 19:14.380
Was I unconscious?

19:14.380 --> 19:19.280
Just for a little bit. Are you okay?
 Want to rest at my place?

19:19.280 --> 19:21.670
No, I'm fine.

19:22.060 --> 19:26.970
Instead, I want to stay 
like this a little longer.

19:27.970 --> 19:30.490
<i>It probably wasn't good that 
he didn't get any sleep.</i>

19:30.970 --> 19:33.570
<i>And then I tired him out 
by making him walk so much.</i>

19:45.030 --> 19:48.000
You tried to protect me, didn't you?

19:48.720 --> 19:49.900
Thank you.

19:50.380 --> 19:52.550
But don't go overboard, okay?

19:53.410 --> 19:58.430
I've been worried about that 
part of you ever since we met.

19:58.950 --> 20:02.400
You don't need to throw yourself 
in front of danger for me.

20:02.800 --> 20:03.810
But...

20:07.200 --> 20:11.720
Even if I study hard and play sports, 
even if I'm as kind as I can be,

20:12.430 --> 20:16.640
in the end, everyone always
chooses someone else over me.

20:17.860 --> 20:20.360
The only thing I have left to give...

20:21.970 --> 20:23.770
is myself.

20:25.850 --> 20:29.250
That's not true. That's not true!

20:29.540 --> 20:34.100
Even if you don't go that far, 
there are people who'd stand by you.

20:34.100 --> 20:36.740
Like... Like me.

20:37.040 --> 20:41.510
I like the way the time passes 
so peacefully when I'm with you.

20:41.510 --> 20:46.670
I like the way you seem to be good at 
everything, but you actually aren't perfect.

20:46.670 --> 20:50.130
I like the way you're kind to those in need.

20:50.520 --> 20:54.270
I like the way you're always 
so honest about your feelings.

20:54.630 --> 20:58.410
You don't need to sacrifice yourself like that.

20:58.410 --> 21:02.020
I really, really like you, Hananoi-kun!

21:05.330 --> 21:08.020
Do you mean it...?

21:09.900 --> 21:15.420
If I'd be so happy if that's true.

21:22.260 --> 21:26.020
<i>Does he understand my feelings for him now?</i>

21:26.990 --> 21:29.160
<i>They're so hard to put into words.</i>

21:29.930 --> 21:37.540
<i>But thank you. Every time you tell me you 
like me, it gives me a lot of strength.</i>

21:38.690 --> 21:42.440
<i>I want to be able to do that
 for Hananoi-kun too.</i>

21:44.600 --> 21:46.080
<i>I want to be of help to him.</i>

21:46.890 --> 21:49.350
<i>I don't want him to smile 
like he's sad inside.</i>

21:49.350 --> 21:52.360
<i>I want to see him smile like 
he's really, truly happy.</i>

21:55.530 --> 21:56.760
<i>Oh...</i>

21:58.700 --> 22:00.600
Is this love?

22:02.710 --> 22:03.640
<i>Hey,</i>

22:07.530 --> 22:07.530
<i>Hananoi-kun...</i>

22:07.530 --> 22:09.660
Alarm

22:07.530 --> 22:09.660
Snooze

22:07.530 --> 22:09.660
Dismiss

22:36.730 --> 22:38.100
<i>Hananoi-kun!</i>

22:48.980 --> 22:50.090
<i>I...</i>

22:50.980 --> 22:52.600
<i>really like you!</i>
